## Rollback Evidence – Task 27

The project was developed using the Superstore dataset and analyzed in MySQL and Excel.

Rollback approach:

- The original dataset was preserved without modification.
- SQL analysis was performed using queries without altering the source data.
- The Excel workbook was created separately for ranking, dashboard and recommendations.
- If any analysis or dashboard change is incorrect, the workbook can be reverted to the saved project copy.
- The original source data remains available for re-analysis.

No destructive changes were made to the original dataset.
